<title>USA: Long Beach Financial IPO cuts price range.</title>
<headline>Long Beach Financial IPO cuts price range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The estimated price range for the initial public offering in Long Beach Financial Corp was reduced to $8-$9 from $10-$12, lead underwriter Friedman Billings Ramsey &amp; Co Inc said on Monday.</p>
<p>The initial public offering, expected to trade this week, retained the proposed number of shares at 21.75 million shares and proposed symbol &quot;LBFC&quot; on the Nasdaq National Market.</p>
<p>Long Beach deals with sub-prime mortgage originators.</p>
</text>
